docs {
  # List Expense Attachments

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/expense/:expense_id`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token: active squad member or platform admin)

  ## Description

  Retrieves all attachments tied to a specific expense (such as receipt images, PDF invoices, and payment confirmations).

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `expense_id` | `int64` | Yes | Unique ID of the expense |

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "uploader_user_id": 1,
          "expense_id": 1,
          "type": "EXPENSE_RECEIPT",
          "original_filename": "receipt.pdf",
          "file_size_bytes": 204800,
          "mime_type": "application/pdf",
          "access_url": "https://storage.example.com/uploads/receipt.pdf",
          "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:00:00Z"
        }
      ],
      "total": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid expense ID format
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `403 Forbidden` — Requester is not a member of the expense's group
  * `404 Not Found` — Expense not found
}
